  <!--
    1.12.229 -> 1.12.230, UNIT 292 TASK 1, UNDER HM-DEC-150. A PATCH, AND IT CHANGES NO BEHAVIOUR AT
    ALL - IT MEASURES ONE.

      Step 4's trace ran before anything was threaded, and it needed a measurement rather than a
      reading: PressingFt4TunesAndDecodesFt4Tests drives thirty seconds of band carrying four real
